<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n108131" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπο-βλήδην</span></b> , 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπο-βλήδαν</span></b>  Diusap.<i><span class="en">
			Stob.
			4.21.17
		</span></i>:—Adv.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>by way of interruption,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. ἠμείβετο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					1
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				292
			</span></i>; 
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποβάλλω</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				111
			</span></i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποβολή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					1.3
				</span></i>
			,<i><span class="en">
				4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>in answer,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				1.699
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				3.400
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Q.S.
				2.147
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>speaking in turn,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Coluth.
				146
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>supposititiously,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. ἐτέκοντο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Man.
					6.292
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>askance,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. ἐσκέψατο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>h.Merc.</u>
					415
				</span></i>
			.</div>
